        print(f"""Import and convert markdownlint configuration files

Usage: {PROGRAM} import [OPTIONS] <FILE>

Arguments:
  <FILE>  Path to markdownlint config file (JSON/YAML)

Options:
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>  Output file path (default: .rumdl.toml)
